    {
      "id": "claim_853d468e27b34ec7b4ddd9be424b20b6",
      "statement": "Encrypted OIFS images support inode format migration from legacy v1 to current v2 via `oifs migrate`. The migration is idempotent (safe on already-migrated images), resumable (tracks progress in SuperBlock::migration_cursor), and crash-safe (journal checkpointed first, inodes rewritten one at a time). The CLI warns once on open if migration would benefit the image. Migration does not re-encrypt data or change encryption keys/scheme.",
